*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CLM0001
*> PURPOSE : INSURANCE CLAIMS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-08-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-02 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 629
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CLMNIGHT STEP040
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CLM0001.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    COPY CLM0001C.
01 RESULT-AREA.
    05 CLM-STAT-CD        PIC X VALUE 'A'.
        88 CLM-INVESTIGATE VALUE 'I'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
0000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM CLAIM-ROUTING
    DISPLAY "CLM-STAT-CD=" CLM-STAT-CD
    STOP RUN.
CLAIM-ROUTING.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN CLM-AMOUNT <= 2500 AND PRIOR-CLAIMS < 2
            MOVE 'A' TO CLM-STAT-CD
        *> LARGE CLAIM INVESTIGATION
        WHEN CLM-AMOUNT > 50000
            SET CLM-INVESTIGATE TO TRUE
        *> NEW POLICY CLAIM
        WHEN POL-MONTHS < 3
            SET CLM-INVESTIGATE TO TRUE
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 'A' TO CLM-STAT-CD
    END-EVALUATE.
